{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|cytology}} An [[organelle]], found in the [[cell]]s of [[green]] [[plant]]s and in [[photosynthetic]] [[algae]], where [[photosynthesis]] takes place, characterized by a high concentration of [[chlorophyll]] and two membranes.

